Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Base configuration and defaults for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
 Provides core APT configuration (disabling recommended and suggested packages
 by default to minimize RAM and disk footprint on older hardware), release
 metadata under /etc/alx/release, and console login branding for Algothix OS.
